---根据类型获取不同的数据类   ---ZHJ-11713添加  设置属性 /卡牌星级装备五行 (前端通过配置的奖励 配置可能大于2维长度的奖励 数组或表作为第三参数)
function StorageManager:GetItemDataClass(Sid, Count, extend)
    local storageType, storageID, sidType = self:CheckSidType(Sid)
    if storageType == nil then
        return nil
    end
    if storageType == _G.StorageType.Artifact then
        local cfg = _G.ConfigManager.artifact_cfg[Sid]
        if not cfg then
            if _G.AppSetting.DEBUG then
                _G.LogError("artifact_cfg表中没有找到配置，sid: " .. Sid)
            end
            return
        end
    end
    if storageType == _G.StorageType.Card then
        if not _G.ConfigManager.card_cfg[Sid] then
            if _G.AppSetting.DEBUG then
                _G.LogError("card_cfg表中没有找到配置，sid: " .. Sid)
            end
            return
        end
    end
    if storageType == _G.StorageType.RelicTeamBuff then
        if not sidType or not _G.ConfigManager[_G.NoInitTypeToCfg[sidType]] or
            not _G.ConfigManager[_G.NoInitTypeToCfg[sidType]][Sid] then
            if _G.AppSetting.DEBUG then
                _G.LogError("没有找到配置，sid: " .. Sid)
            end
            return
        end
    end
    local data = ItemData[storageType].New()
    data:Parse({
        sid = Sid,
        uid = Sid,
        num = Count or 0,
        count = Count or 0,
        sidType = sidType
    })
    if extend then
        data:ParseExtend(extend)
    end
    return data
end

---判断sid类型,仓库ID
function StorageManager:CheckSidType(sid)
    if nil == sid or sid == 0 then
        return nil
    end
    local cfg = {}
    if sid <= _G.ItemSidJudgeSection.ResPropMax or currencySids[sid] then
        return _G.StorageType.ResProp, _G.StorageID.ResProp
    else
        ---取sid前三位判断是什么类型
        local Sid = sid
        while (Sid > 1000) do
            Sid = Sid / 10
        end
        Sid = _G.math.floor(Sid)
        if Sid >= _G.ItemSidJudgeSection.CardMin and Sid < _G.ItemSidJudgeSection.CardMax then
            return _G.StorageType.Card, _G.StorageID.Card
        elseif Sid == _G.ItemSidJudgeSection.Equipment then
            -- 装备
            return _G.StorageType.Equipment, _G.StorageID.Equipment
        elseif Sid == _G.ItemSidJudgeSection.Remains then
            return _G.StorageType.Remains, _G.StorageID.Remains
        elseif (Sid >= _G.ItemSidJudgeSection.PropMin and Sid < _G.ItemSidJudgeSection.PropMax) or Sid ==
            _G.ItemSidJudgeSection.ProgressChest or Sid == _G.ItemSidJudgeSection.RechargeAccumulate or Sid ==
            _G.ItemSidJudgeSection.VoucherDiscount then
            -- 道具
            cfg = _G.ConfigManager.item_cfg[sid]
            if cfg then
                if cfg.Field == _G.StorageID.Prop then
                    return _G.StorageType.Prop, _G.StorageID.Prop
                elseif cfg.Field == _G.StorageID.Material then
                    return _G.StorageType.Material, _G.StorageID.Material
                elseif cfg.Field == _G.StorageID.Debris then
                    return _G.StorageType.Debris, _G.StorageID.Debris
                end
            end
        elseif Sid == _G.ItemSidJudgeSection.Decoration then
            return _G.StorageType.Decoration, _G.StorageID.Decoration
        elseif Sid == _G.ItemSidJudgeSection.Carving then
            return _G.StorageType.Carving, _G.StorageID.Carving
        elseif Sid == _G.ItemSidJudgeSection.Task then
            return _G.StorageType.Material, _G.StorageID.Material
        elseif Sid == _G.ItemSidJudgeSection.Artifact then
            return _G.StorageType.Artifact, _G.StorageID.Artifact
        elseif Sid == _G.ItemSidJudgeSection.Spiritual then
            return _G.StorageType.Spiritual, _G.StorageID.Spiritual
        elseif Sid == _G.ItemSidJudgeSection.RingGod then
            return _G.StorageType.RingGod, _G.StorageID.RingGod
        elseif table.ContainsValue(_G.NoInitType, Sid) then
            return _G.StorageType.RelicTeamBuff, _G.StorageID.RelicTeamBuff, Sid
        elseif Sid == _G.ItemSidJudgeSection.Gemstone then
            return _G.StorageType.Gemstone, _G.StorageID.Gemstone
        end
    end
    return nil
end

